OL,3,ATrain station returning to village
OL,4,Aafter more than 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is beginning on bringing a train
OL,7,Fstation back to the heart of a Greater
OL,8,FManchester village more than a century
OL,9,Fafter its original station closed.
OL,11,FCheadle in Stockport had a station just
OL,12,Foff the high street up until 1917.
OL,14,FFunding for a new hub, which would be
OL,15,Fbuilt next to Alexandra Hospital, was
OL,16,Fgiven the green light in 2022, with
OL,17,Fplanning permission granted in 2023 but
OL,18,Fconcerns about its effect on the
OL,19,Ftimetabling of trains elsewhere on the
OL,20,Fnetwork led to delays.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
